      "end": 324,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Burns Cottage (Atlanta)\nThe Burns Cottage in Atlanta , Georgia is a replica of the birthplace of Robert Burns in Scotland . The Atlanta cottage was built by the Burns Club Atlanta in 1911 , using measurements of the original cottage . The interior was adapted for club use , with a meeting room replacing the barn and byre ."
