      "end": 529,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Robert Burns World Federation\nThe Robert Burns World Federation is a literary society based at the Dower House , Dean Castle Country Park , Kilmarnock , Ayrshire , Scotland . The organisation was founded in 1885 to educate the public about the life , poetry and works of the poet Robert Burns . The board of the Robert Burns World Federation ( RBWF ) is composed of 3 Office Bearers -- a President , a Senior Vice-President , a Junior Vice-President and Convenors of heritage , literature , marketing , schools and an archivist ."
     }
