      "text": "Gracie: A Love Story\nGracie : A Love Story is a 1988 biography of comedian Gracie Allen by George Burns . The tribute to Burns ' wife and professional partner reviews their life together and contrasts Allen 's scatterbrained public persona with the intelligent actress and devoted wife she actually was . It was offered as a Book of the Month Club selection . For the audiobook version , Burns received the 1991 Grammy Award for Best Spoken Word Album ."
